**/cypress/screenshots

# Claude Code — per-machine agent settings.
# `CLAUDE.md` files ARE tracked (they are project documentation); only the
# machine-local permission/settings file is ignored. Listed here rather than
# relying on a developer's global gitignore, which doesn't travel with a clone.
.claude/settings.local.json
**/.claude/settings.local.json